<view class="page" ><view class="eyebrow">OUR TABLE / 修改聚会</view><button wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="primary" bindtap="signIn">微信登录</button><view class="muted" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view><view class="title"><text>留好这一桌。</text></view><view class="field-label">聚会封面 · 选填</view><image class="cover-preview" src="{{coverImage}}" mode="aspectFit" binderror="coverError"/><view class="cover-choices"><view class="cover-choice {{coverPreset===item.code?'cover-chosen':''}}" wx:for="{{covers}}" wx:key="code" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="cover"><image class="cover-thumb" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit"/><text>{{item.label}}{{coverPreset===item.code?' ✓':''}}</text></view></view><view class="field-label">聚会主题 · 最多20字</view><input class="input" value="{{theme}}" placeholder="周末一起吃火锅" maxlength="255" data-field="theme" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}"/><view class="field-label">地点 · 最多30字</view><input class="input" value="{{location}}" placeholder="在哪里相聚" maxlength="255" data-field="location" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}"/><view class="field-label">开始时间 · 北京时间</view><view class="dates"><picker mode="date" value="{{startDate}}" data-field="startDate" bindchange="input" disabled="{{busy || retryPending || startLocked}}"><view class="date-value">{{startDate}}</view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{startTime}}" data-field="startTime" bindchange="input" disabled="{{busy || retryPending || startLocked}}"><view class="date-value">{{startTime}}</view></picker></view><view class="field-label">计划结束时间</view><view class="dates"><picker mode="date" value="{{endDate}}" data-field="endDate" bindchange="input" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}"><view class="date-value">{{endDate}}</view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{endTime}}" data-field="endTime" bindchange="input" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}"><view class="date-value">{{endTime}}</view></picker></view><view class="notice">计划时间不会自动结束聚会。已开始的开始时间保留；过去的计划结束时间可原样保留。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{retryPending}}">上次保存结果尚未核对，输入已保留。请核对同一次操作。</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{conflicted}}">最新：{{latest.theme}} · {{latest.location}}</view><button wx:if="{{conflicted && latest.canEdit}}" class="secondary" bindtap="latest" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">核对最新信息，保留文字草稿</button><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || (!retryPending && (!ready || conflicted))}}">{{retryPending?'核对上次保存':'保存修改'}}</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="detail" disabled="{{busy}}">返回聚会</button></view>